WEBVTT

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:09.801
Our pulses beating so fast ♪

00:00:10.635 --> 00:00:13.179
No way, that guy singing over there is...

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:17.767
Love is like a heartbeat  ♪

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:19.436
Now gaze at me ♪

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:23.565
I gotta get away, but
I'm intrigued by that song.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:28.945
And wake up ♪

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:32.115
But if I stay around, I'm dead!

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:36.536
Eliza ♪

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.875
My Faust Love ♪

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:48.923
You are the little guy.

00:02:23.226 --> 00:02:25.395
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:30.942
Okay, you don't pronounce my name like that

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:33.236
It's Chocolove, got it?

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:36.072
Now say it with me, Chocolove!

00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:37.407
Shut up.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:40.326
Pointy-head’s got me all worked up.

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:42.579
Just be quiet, Chocolove

00:02:42.871 --> 00:02:46.958
What the hell? Is that
how you treat a teammate?

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:49.002
Who's my teammate, huh?

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:52.463
What's my name, fool?!

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:56.134
I'm surprised you made it here safely, Anna

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:58.636
It's me you're talking about

00:02:59.387 --> 00:03:03.266
Manta and Tamao both had a
hard time with the Great Spirit.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.517
Manta?!

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:06.686
Don't look so surprised.

00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:09.606
No, it's just that Manta...

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:15.778
H-hey Yoh-kun.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.448
It's been so long.

00:03:18.948 --> 00:03:20.116
Faust VIII!

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.202
Oh, this might be trouble...

00:03:22.619 --> 00:03:24.913
What?! A skeleton dog?

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:30.376
I see you're as carefree
as ever. How I envy you.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.338
So, what's Manta doing on your lap?

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:36.090
I just met him by chance.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:39.469
And then he fainted for some reason.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:41.679
So I brought him to you.

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.891
It's good to see you again.

00:03:45.808 --> 00:03:48.561
I wanted to talk to you.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.272
Talk?

00:03:50.297 --> 00:03:53.316
You're better not out for revenge.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:59.197
If I could bring my beloved Eliza by taking
revenge, I would do it many times over.

00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:05.036
I wish only to talk to her.

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:08.331
To take her hands and dance with her.

00:04:09.374 --> 00:04:13.878
I became a Shaman and joined
this event for that reason alone.

00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:16.506
But I've heard bad news.

00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:20.260
I won't be able to
participate in the next fight.

00:04:20.285 --> 00:04:23.425
And because you are the
only other Shamans I know...

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:28.434
Yoh-kun, would you
let me join your team?

00:04:30.853 --> 00:04:32.480
What the hell?!

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:34.482
No way! Never!

00:04:34.983 --> 00:04:38.569
We already have Lyserg! He's
the third member of our team!

00:04:39.028 --> 00:04:40.822
We're already full.

00:04:41.197 --> 00:04:42.573
Now go away.

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.160
Is that so?

00:04:48.997 --> 00:04:53.584
It's no surprise, come Frankensteiny.

00:04:57.005 --> 00:04:58.673
Sorry, Faust.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.718
Was I too hard on him?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.727
What a surprise.

00:05:11.185 --> 00:05:14.772
Who would've imagined
you'd show up on Faust's lap?

00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:17.066
It's not funny!

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:19.402
He did cut you open.

00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:21.696
Cut you open?!

00:05:23.573 --> 00:05:25.033
I'm sorry for him.

00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:27.952
But I don't care what his problems are.

00:05:28.494 --> 00:05:30.997
Lyserg is better looking...

00:05:31.539 --> 00:05:34.375
I mean, he's just as
worthy of our pity.

00:05:34.709 --> 00:05:38.713
But Faust really isn't a bad guy, you know.

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:42.341
I think he's just too focused.

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:50.183
His love for Eliza-san and obsession
with medicine turned him into what he is.

00:05:50.683 --> 00:05:53.519
And it might be good to
have a doctor on the team.

00:05:54.896 --> 00:05:58.107
That settles it.
I'm putting him on your team.

00:05:58.483 --> 00:05:58.983
Huh?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.194
H-hold it, boss!

00:06:01.652 --> 00:06:02.528
Shut up, Ryu

00:06:04.405 --> 00:06:06.699
I don't know anything about Lyserg...

00:06:07.075 --> 00:06:10.745
But I've seen what Faust can do firsthand.

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:12.789
He's powerful

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:16.042
His willpower and
determination are superhuman.

00:06:16.935 --> 00:06:21.609
If he can develop his power even further,
with my help, his wish will come true.

00:06:23.687 --> 00:06:26.944
I have the technique to
help him develop his potential

00:06:26.969 --> 00:06:30.223
His Shamanic skills are self-taught.

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:37.396
If I resurrect Eliza with true
necromancy, his dream will be realized.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.358
After that, I'll have his eternal loyalty.

00:06:41.096 --> 00:06:44.946
Then he'll be the exclusive
doctor at my future hot springs inn!

00:06:45.154 --> 00:06:47.406
He'll draw in big crowds!

00:06:47.866 --> 00:06:51.010
The ultimate therapeutic hot
springs that goes beyond esthetics!

00:06:51.035 --> 00:06:54.163
Middle-aged women from
everywhere will flock there!

00:06:54.789 --> 00:06:56.249
That's the real reason?!

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:58.918
Anna's spirit is in full bloom.

00:06:59.293 --> 00:07:02.255
Now that that's settled,
let's start your training.

00:07:02.463 --> 00:07:04.507
That's why I'm here, after all.

00:07:04.924 --> 00:07:09.762
There's no time to waste!
I gotta find Lyserg right away!

00:07:12.765 --> 00:07:16.811
Are you sure you can defeat Hao?

00:07:18.396 --> 00:07:19.689
Absolutely.

00:07:20.398 --> 00:07:22.692
We have lots of allies.

00:07:23.192 --> 00:07:27.864
And above all, our master possesses
enormous power that surpasses even Hao's.

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:32.326
So you see, there's no
reason to cry, Lyserg Diethel.

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.997
You've struggled on
all alone up to now.

00:07:36.873 --> 00:07:41.335
I'm sure your parents are at
peace seeing how well you're doing.

00:07:42.378 --> 00:07:45.631
It's not enough, I'm still weak

00:07:46.674 --> 00:07:48.301
So you want to be strong?

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:53.097
I want you to meet our master,
they'll give you the power you crave.

00:07:57.518 --> 00:08:00.188
As promised, here's the Chō-Senjiryakketsu.

00:08:02.064 --> 00:08:03.107
How ironic

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:08.070
That I have to rely on this
abominable thing that Hao left behind.

00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:10.194
I'm grateful

00:08:10.219 --> 00:08:13.743
You came all the way
to America to deliver this.

00:08:14.535 --> 00:08:16.787
It's because an Asakura asked me to.

00:08:17.371 --> 00:08:21.083
But, is it really okay for me to keep this?

00:08:21.876 --> 00:08:23.878
I doubt Yoh-kun has learned it.

00:08:24.462 --> 00:08:25.463
It's all right.

00:08:25.922 --> 00:08:27.924
Anything to defeat Hao.

00:08:29.091 --> 00:08:29.926
Besides...

00:08:33.387 --> 00:08:36.724
I've already mastered
the Chō-Senjiryakketsu.

00:08:37.642 --> 00:08:38.518
Impossible

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.312
Those are Hao's Shikigami!

00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:44.398
Zenki and Goki.

00:08:45.316 --> 00:08:46.901
They were guarding the book.

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:52.532
So I overpowered them and
made them my guardian spirits.

00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:56.410
Anna-chan, just what are you?

00:08:56.994 --> 00:08:58.454
What about you?

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:03.834
I've wondered why you're always so
helpful to Yoh, you've got your own agenda.

00:09:05.544 --> 00:09:10.132
But now it looks like all the
pieces are coming together.

00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:16.222
It's the puzzle of this great, big
planet that moves the hollow world.

00:09:17.181 --> 00:09:20.559
The collision of souls in pure
communion, the shamanic chorus.

00:09:21.435 --> 00:09:24.438
The ruler of this world
is the Shaman King.

00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:32.905
I'm the Goddess of victory that will guide
Yoh in his quest to be the Shaman King.

00:09:35.533 --> 00:09:38.369
And then that day had finally arrived.

00:09:38.926 --> 00:09:42.348
The tournament is taking
place on this uninhabited island?

00:09:42.373 --> 00:09:45.388
I guess it was in Tokyo after all

00:09:46.294 --> 00:09:48.879
We're 800 kilometers south of Tokyo.

00:09:49.245 --> 00:09:52.732
It's an uninhabited island,
with remains of factories.

00:09:52.757 --> 00:09:57.201
People come here during the tourist
season, there are only a few accomodations.

00:09:57.226 --> 00:09:59.920
It's a great place for tournaments.

00:09:59.945 --> 00:10:02.685
But what's with the helicopters?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.560
I didn't know there were
that many competitors left.

00:10:05.585 --> 00:10:07.540
They're cheerleaders.

00:10:07.565 --> 00:10:08.065
Huh?!

00:10:08.733 --> 00:10:11.068
It's finally time for the main event.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:17.700
They've all come at their own expense
to root for those of you who survived.

00:10:18.576 --> 00:10:20.995
Look at the Arena we built.

00:10:21.495 --> 00:10:23.789
It's awesome!

00:10:24.248 --> 00:10:29.629
Ridiculous, I bet you opened it up
to spectators just to make money.

00:10:30.338 --> 00:10:35.593
Firs they tell us we can never see our
families, and after that first trial, this...

00:10:41.098 --> 00:10:42.016
What's wrong, Ren?

00:10:42.183 --> 00:10:44.393
If you look outside, I'll kill you.

00:10:45.519 --> 00:10:48.314
Hurry, they finally posted it!

00:10:48.606 --> 00:10:51.150
The roster of the tournament!

00:10:56.113 --> 00:10:57.883
There are 63 fighters total.

00:10:57.908 --> 00:11:02.766
Among those, the 12 Shamans of the four
winning teams will move on to the next event.

00:11:02.791 --> 00:11:05.206
It'll be tougher than I expected.

00:11:05.873 --> 00:11:09.418
And only team names are listed...

00:11:10.086 --> 00:11:13.881
There is no way to
know who will fight whom

00:11:17.635 --> 00:11:21.263
I can't tell which team Lyserg is on!

00:11:21.389 --> 00:11:24.975
Calm down, stop crying.

00:11:25.267 --> 00:11:26.769
He's right, Ryu-kun.

00:11:27.353 --> 00:11:32.858
If he's not dead already, we'll
have to fight him eventually.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:38.114
No! I don't wanna fight Lyserg!

00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:41.534
Why'd you have to say that, Faust?

00:11:42.076 --> 00:11:43.035
I'm sorry

00:11:44.578 --> 00:11:46.247
Do you know what this means?

00:11:47.164 --> 00:11:51.669
For you to advance in this
tournament, you'll have to fight Ren.

00:11:52.878 --> 00:11:55.229
I've done all I can to prepare you.

00:11:55.254 --> 00:11:57.466
Now it's all up to you.

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:02.555
This is kind of a shock.

00:12:04.265 --> 00:12:06.267
Oh well, I guess it's all right.

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:08.936
I'm sure that's what he wants.

00:12:22.783 --> 00:12:25.911
I'm one of the 10 Patch officiants.

00:12:26.245 --> 00:12:29.123
I am Radim.

00:12:32.751 --> 00:12:35.129
But before we begin the contest...

00:12:35.921 --> 00:12:39.383
Let me explain the rules, you rats!

00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:40.759
Too fast.

00:12:41.469 --> 00:12:45.723
It may be boring, but you'd better
behave and listen up, you idiots!

00:12:46.307 --> 00:12:48.350
Shaman Fight in Tokyo!

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:50.478
The rules of tournament one:

00:12:50.936 --> 00:12:54.694
The event is 3 on 3 with no time limit.

00:12:54.719 --> 00:12:56.359
Guardian spirits are allowed.

00:12:56.384 --> 00:12:59.945
When no one in the team
can engage their Over Soul...

00:13:00.321 --> 00:13:02.782
or goes outside the totem pole area...

00:13:03.157 --> 00:13:06.243
Or if the team decides not to continue.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:07.745
They will be defeated!

00:13:08.496 --> 00:13:10.915
That's it!

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:17.922
And of course, no spectators are
allowed to help of interfere in the fights!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:25.346
There's an Over Soul force field between the
4 totem poles and nothing can get through!

00:13:26.013 --> 00:13:28.974
So chucking things at me is a waste of time!

00:13:29.266 --> 00:13:31.268
Yeah!

00:13:31.519 --> 00:13:34.313
That's a weird officiant

00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:37.900
They're all pretty weird, if you ask me.

00:13:38.067 --> 00:13:40.653
Hahaha, he's funny.

00:13:40.861 --> 00:13:42.363
It's no time to laugh.

00:13:43.572 --> 00:13:45.074
Boss!
Yoh-kun!

00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:47.701
You're always like this.

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:50.955
I hope you realize who's
fighting the first battle.

00:13:51.747 --> 00:13:53.666
Let me introduce the teams!

00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:59.880
The first team chosen
by the Great Spirit is...

00:14:00.381 --> 00:14:02.007
Team The Ren!

00:14:02.925 --> 00:14:05.177
What the hell's a Ren, you ask?

00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:09.056
He's a scary little brat who
named his team after himself!

00:14:09.431 --> 00:14:11.934
Yeah! Go Ren!

00:14:12.268 --> 00:14:14.061
What about Ren?

00:14:14.311 --> 00:14:17.648
Moron, what I'm saying
is they're your opponents.

00:14:19.066 --> 00:14:23.612
Team Earth, Team Flower, Team Moon and Team Star.

00:14:24.238 --> 00:14:26.365
Those team names
seem to go together.

00:14:27.866 --> 00:14:30.411
I bet they're all Hao's people.

00:14:31.036 --> 00:14:33.289
Wow, what a crowd.

00:14:33.497 --> 00:14:35.624
I'm getting nervous.

00:14:35.833 --> 00:14:39.044
Oh yeah? Well, I'm getting excited.

00:14:39.461 --> 00:14:42.131
And now their opponents
are entering the arena!

00:14:42.756 --> 00:14:46.760
That's us! Yeah!

00:14:47.386 --> 00:14:49.138
Who are they again?

00:14:51.473 --> 00:14:52.892
Oh, they're Boz!

00:14:53.642 --> 00:14:58.606
Hey, these guys have a weird team
name, and what's with the instruments?

00:14:58.898 --> 00:15:02.359
Actually, we're musicians!

00:15:03.068 --> 00:15:07.616
Wh-where in trouble!
They're Hao's minions!

00:15:07.641 --> 00:15:09.074
What're we gonna do, Ren?

00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:12.077
We're matched with the likely winners!

00:15:12.369 --> 00:15:14.997
Yeah, but Boz...

00:15:15.122 --> 00:15:16.373
Don't say it, Horohoro.

00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:19.668
Leave them to Chocolove.

00:15:20.294 --> 00:15:22.713
I don't deal with small fry.

00:15:23.464 --> 00:15:24.089
What?

00:15:24.423 --> 00:15:26.967
I'll take the leader.

00:15:31.096 --> 00:15:35.267
H-hey hang on! That's not what we agreed on, Ren!

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:37.269
Hey, hey, hey

00:15:37.519 --> 00:15:39.688
Who are you calling small fry?

00:15:40.564 --> 00:15:43.651
Do you know who we are?

00:15:44.151 --> 00:15:46.695
And who our boss is?

00:15:47.363 --> 00:15:49.782
Oh uhm, that's...

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.576
Team Earth is pretty aggressive!

00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:54.703
They just can't wait to mix it up!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.831
The whole arena is
humming with deadly energy!

00:15:58.374 --> 00:16:00.292
Goldva-sama, over to you!

00:16:04.046 --> 00:16:11.512
By the will of the Great Spirit, these 63
chosen Shamans have gathered here.

00:16:12.012 --> 00:16:14.306
All that remains is to fight!

00:16:18.268 --> 00:16:21.689
Okay Okay Thank you Okay!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:24.441
Then let's get started!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.027
The Shaman Fight in Tokyo...

00:16:27.236 --> 00:16:29.530
The First tournament,
Match #1!

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.657
Team The Ren...

00:16:31.907 --> 00:16:34.284
Versus, Team Earth!

00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:36.662
Fight!

00:16:40.249 --> 00:16:42.668
We'll start off with a catchy beat.

00:16:43.043 --> 00:16:46.296
And make a blood offering out of you!

00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:47.673
Why me?

00:16:48.048 --> 00:16:50.509
Chimi Chimi Moryo!

00:16:52.261 --> 00:16:53.429
Whoa!

00:16:53.595 --> 00:16:57.266
Team Earth launches a
surprise attack, those jerks!

00:16:58.642 --> 00:17:01.437
Our mega hit "Chimi Chimi Moryo" Thank you!

00:17:01.937 --> 00:17:04.606
There, now it's your turn!

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:08.318
See, they're not so great.

00:17:09.403 --> 00:17:10.320
Yeah

00:17:11.918 --> 00:17:13.543
What a surprise.

00:17:13.568 --> 00:17:16.577
Maybe Hao's minions
aren't so tough after all.

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.204
Claws?!

00:17:19.329 --> 00:17:21.582
No way! How'd he..?

00:17:22.124 --> 00:17:24.668
Forget it, time for "Chimi Chimi Moryo"!

00:17:24.793 --> 00:17:26.253
The remix!

00:17:27.087 --> 00:17:29.965
Remix? But that's the same song.

00:17:38.182 --> 00:17:42.060
Sorry guys, but you don't have a chance.

00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:47.399
With his nose and speed, my Mic
can easily handle spirits of that caliber.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:51.195
He's eating our Moryo!

00:17:51.653 --> 00:17:55.032
They're all glitz and no substance.

00:17:56.658 --> 00:17:59.328
I guess it's time for me to do my trick.

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:00.996
Y-your trick?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.749
What's he gonna do?

00:18:06.627 --> 00:18:11.840
I got this technique from
an old man in New York.

00:18:12.966 --> 00:18:15.135
I'm the Black Jaguar!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:18.555
O Descendant of the Black Jaguar...

00:18:19.139 --> 00:18:23.644
Your nose finds all.
Your eyes see all.

00:18:24.061 --> 00:18:28.232
Your legs catch all.
Your claws rend all.

00:18:28.982 --> 00:18:31.693
You are the strongest
beast of the continent...

00:18:32.194 --> 00:18:34.488
Once you hear the Jaguar's call...

00:18:34.988 --> 00:18:37.616
The Jaguar's soul will be yours.

00:18:40.577 --> 00:18:41.745
What the hell is he?!

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.001
Don't come near us!

00:18:57.094 --> 00:18:58.136
He dodged them all!

00:18:59.054 --> 00:19:00.597
Shaft!

00:19:11.859 --> 00:19:14.194
Wh-what the hell?!

00:19:14.444 --> 00:19:17.364
Chocolove of Team The Ren...

00:19:17.739 --> 00:19:19.992
In.. In just a brief moment...

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:23.954
defeated Boz of Team Earth!

00:19:24.413 --> 00:19:26.331
What happened?!

00:19:26.665 --> 00:19:30.335
It was so fast, I missed it!

00:19:30.836 --> 00:19:33.505
What speed, what was that?

00:19:33.964 --> 00:19:36.967
Yeah, he really is a Jaguar.

00:19:37.467 --> 00:19:41.722
He's better than I thought. He integrated
his own body into his Over Soul.

00:19:42.389 --> 00:19:44.725
Anna-sama, you actually know what he did?

00:19:45.601 --> 00:19:47.477
Yes of course.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:53.525
He let his Guardian Spirit take over his head
and limbs and integrate with his own Over Soul.

00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:56.695
Specifically, he surrendered
his eyes and his nails.

00:19:57.237 --> 00:20:01.116
He allowed the Jaguar to possess
him, it's a special kind of integration.

00:20:01.141 --> 00:20:02.876
A really advanced technique.

00:20:04.536 --> 00:20:09.625
In other words, he's a Shaman who
transforms into a Jaguar via his Over Soul.

00:20:10.042 --> 00:20:13.462
Hehe, Chocolove's ability amazed everybody.

00:20:14.171 --> 00:20:18.133
That was a good start,
don't you think, Ren?

00:20:18.717 --> 00:20:20.802
Hmm, we'll see about that

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:24.097
I was surprised the first time too.

00:20:24.637 --> 00:20:28.769
Just look at him, so relaxed. As if
everything's going just as planned.

00:20:30.979 --> 00:20:32.314
Hahaha!

00:20:32.522 --> 00:20:34.733
They're really beaten up.

00:20:34.983 --> 00:20:36.875
I knew they'd be funny.

00:20:36.906 --> 00:20:39.568
See? Wasn't it a good
idea to include Boz?

00:20:39.593 --> 00:20:41.615
Indeed, Hao-sama.

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:45.994
But are you sure Peyote can
handle them all on his own?

00:20:46.745 --> 00:20:47.871
Who knows.

00:20:48.747 --> 00:20:52.125
As far as I'm concerned,
this is just for entertainment.

00:20:53.126 --> 00:20:57.547
But it'll be more entertaining if he wins.

00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:01.899
Dead already? How pathetic.

00:21:01.924 --> 00:21:03.929
How long are you going to sleep.

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:08.600
What?

00:21:09.351 --> 00:21:11.144
Hold it, Peyote.

00:21:12.104 --> 00:21:14.398
We can't fight anymore

00:21:14.815 --> 00:21:16.191
Sorry, but we're finished.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.318
They're right about that.

00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:20.904
You'd better not take my Shaft lightly.

00:21:20.929 --> 00:21:23.294
If they keep fighting, they'll die

00:21:23.319 --> 00:21:26.115
Then why don't you kill them?

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.620
Aren't they your enemies?

00:21:31.331 --> 00:21:32.749
Fools.

00:21:33.041 --> 00:21:35.294
I'm not playing with you!

00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:41.800
Boz is way out of their league!

00:21:42.259 --> 00:21:44.594
No, not yet. Fight more.

00:21:45.809 --> 00:21:48.403
What, you shouldn't
even be able to stand...

00:21:48.682 --> 00:21:50.308
What's wrong?

00:21:50.642 --> 00:21:53.729
Do it. You want to win, don't you?

00:21:54.479 --> 00:21:58.066
What's going on? If I hit
them again, they're gonna die.

00:21:58.483 --> 00:21:59.818
Ren, we're in trouble.

00:21:59.943 --> 00:22:01.945
They're tougher than I thought.

00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:05.866
Don't be stupid, Boz
is already unconscious.

00:22:06.616 --> 00:22:08.160
He can't fool me.

00:22:08.618 --> 00:22:10.620
He was waiting for this.

00:22:11.663 --> 00:22:14.624
So that he could use Boz as his medium.

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:50.178
Next time: "Chocolove's Christmas"
